OL,3,GNEWSACalls to ban delivery drivers with
OL,4,AL plates
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorcyclists without a full driving
OL,7,Flicence could be banned from working as
OL,8,Fdelivery drivers in London.
OL,10,FLast month the London Assembly passed a
OL,11,Fmotion calling on the government to
OL,12,Fprohibit the use of provisional
OL,13,Flicences for commercial work, to
OL,14,Fimprove road safety.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
