OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1787633748
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACalls to ban delivery drivers with
OL,4,AL plates
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurrently moped drivers can become fast
OL,7,Ffood delivery drivers once they have
OL,8,Fobtained their Compulsory Basic
OL,9,FTraining (CBT) certificate, which
OL,10,Fremains valid for two years and can be
OL,11,Frenewed repeatedly without any
OL,12,Frequirement to progress to a full
OL,13,Fdriving test.
OL,15,FA Department for Transport spokesperson
OL,16,Fsaid the Driver and Vehicle Standards
OL,17,FAgency (DVSA) had consulted on reforms
OL,18,Fto the CBT and it was analysing the
OL,19,Fresponses.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
